{"sectionId":"ecology/ecology","items":[{"id":"ecology--ecology-k001","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"지수성장은 dN/dt=rN, 로지스틱 성장은 dN/dt=rN(1−N/K)로 표현하며 K는 환경수용력의 모형적 매개변수다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k002","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"밀도 의존 요인은 경쟁·질병 등, 밀도 비의존 요인은 일부 기상·교란 등이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k003","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"생존곡선 I형은 후기 사망 증가, II형은 일정한 사망 위험, III형은 초기 사망률이 높은 형태를 대표한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k004","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"종간 관계에는 경쟁, 포식, 기생, 상리공생, 편리공생 등이 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k005","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"일차 생산자는 외부 에너지를 이용해 유기물을 합성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k006","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"GPP에서 생산자의 호흡을 빼면 NPP이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k007","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"에너지는 영양단계를 거치며 열로 소산되고 물질은 생지화학적 순환을 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k008","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"천이는 교란 후 군집 변화이며 토양 형성 여부에 따라 일차·이차 천이를 구분할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k009","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"종 다양성은 종 풍부도와 균등도를 포함한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k010","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"NPP=GPP−생산자 호흡.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k011","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"로지스틱 모형에서 성장량은 N=K/2에서 최대.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k012","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"물질은 순환하고 에너지는 흐른다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"ecology--ecology-k013","sectionId":"ecology/ecology","unitId":"ecology","subject":"biology","text":"0이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}